<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="T1de — украинский игрок Counter-Strike 2. FACEIT: Ky0suke4.">
<meta name="keywords" content="T1de, T1de CS2, T1de Ukraine, T1de FACEIT, Ky0suke4">

<title>T1de — CS2 Player</title>

<style>
* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
}

body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #08090d;
    color: white;
    min-height: 100vh;
}

body::before {
    content: "";
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%, #3b1010, transparent 40%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #08090d, #15161c);
    z-index: -1;
}

.container {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 25px;
}

nav {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
}

.logo {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
}

.logo span {
    color: #ff3030;
}

.badge {
    border: 1px solid #333;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    color: #aaa;
    font-size: 12px;
}

.hero {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 110px 10px 100px;
}

.kicker {
    color: #ff4040;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 5px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

h1 {
    font-size: clamp(70px, 16vw, 150px);
    line-height: .85;
    letter-spacing: -7px;
    text-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(255,40,40,.3);
}

.subtitle {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 30px auto;
    color: #aaa;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
}

.btn {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #e93232;
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 16px 28px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: bold;
    transition: .2s;
}

.btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    background: #ff4545;
}

.grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 15px;
}

.card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.04);
    border: 1px solid #292a31;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 25px;
}

.label {
    color: #777;
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.value {
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: bold;
}

section {
    margin-bottom: 70px;
}

h2 {
    font-size: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
}

p {
    color: #aaa;
    line-height: 1.8;
}

.search {
    margin-top: 20px;
    padding: 20px;
    border-left: 3px solid #e93232;
    background: #111217;
    color: #aaa;
    line-height: 2;
}

footer {
    text-align: center;
    border-top: 1px solid #222;
    padding: 30px;
    color: #666;
    font-size: 12px;
}

@media(max-width:650px) {
    .grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .hero {
        padding-top: 70px;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

<nav>
    <div class="logo">T<span>1</span>DE</div>
    <div class="badge">🇺🇦 UKRAINE • CS2</div>
</nav>

<div class="hero">
    <div class="kicker">COUNTER-STRIKE 2</div>

    <h1>T1DE</h1>

    <div class="subtitle">
        Ukrainian CS2 player focused on competitive improvement
        and the path toward professional esports.
    </div>

    <a class="btn"
       href="https://www.faceit.com/ru/players/Ky0suke4"
       target="_blank">
       VIEW FACEIT PROFILE
    </a>
</div>

<section class="grid">

    <div class="card">
        <div class="label">Nickname</div>
        <div class="value">T1de</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="label">Game</div>
        <div class="value">Counter-Strike 2</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="label">Country</div>
        <div class="value">🇺🇦 Ukraine</div>
    </div>

</section>

<section>
    <h2>About T1de</h2>

    <p>
        T1de is a young Ukrainian Counter-Strike 2 player
        developing in the competitive scene. His goal is to
        improve individual skill, teamwork and eventually
        reach the professional esports level.
    </p>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Find T1de</h2>

    <div class="search">
        T1de CS2<br>
        T1de Ukraine<br>
        T1de FACEIT<br>
        T1de Counter-Strike 2<br>
        Ky0suke4
    </div>
</section>

<footer>
    © 2026 T1de • Counter-Strike 2
</footer>

</div>

</body>
</html>
